---
export const title = 'Usage';
export const order = 100;
import DemoComponentCard from '../../../../components/DemoComponentCard.astro';
---

<p>
  The avatar shows the image at <code>src</code>. Without one, or when the image fails to load, it
  shows the initials of <code>name</code> (the first letters of its first and last words), and without
  a name a person icon. It is named by <code>label</code>, or else <code>name</code>.
</p>

<DemoComponentCard lang={'html'} inline>
  <wc-avatar name='Ada Lovelace' src='/assets/img/avatar.xs.webp'></wc-avatar>
  <wc-avatar name='Grace Brewster Hopper'></wc-avatar>
  <wc-avatar name='Ada Lovelace' src='/does-not-exist.webp'></wc-avatar>
  <wc-avatar label='Unknown user'></wc-avatar>
</DemoComponentCard>

<h3>Sizes</h3>

<p>
  <code>size</code> is <code>sm</code> (1.5rem), <code>md</code> (2rem, default) or <code>lg</code>
  (3rem). Setting <code>--avatar-size</code> directly still wins.
</p>

<DemoComponentCard lang={'html'} inline>
  <wc-avatar name='Ada Lovelace' size='sm'></wc-avatar>
  <wc-avatar name='Ada Lovelace'></wc-avatar>
  <wc-avatar name='Ada Lovelace' size='lg'></wc-avatar>
</DemoComponentCard>
